frame 0 at 0ms
 rataflow-view · 135x40 @100% · modal-runtime-canvas.json · 11 nodes · 8 edges · q quit

       worker and runtime: the two RPC seams
       Task input plus control RPCs down; events plus management RPCs back. Two directed seams, never one arrow.

       ╭─────────────╮                                  ╭────────────╮
       │             │◀─────────────────────────────────│            │
       │modal-runtime│     task input + control RPCs    │modal-worker│
       │             │───╮ events + management RPCs   ╭▶│            │
       ╰─────────────╯   ╰────────────────────────────╯ ╰────────────╯


       ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
       task dispatch down to the container
       modal-runtime dispatches to the Task engine, which starts a Container backend that runs the user process.

       ╭─────────────╮                   ╭───────────╮                   ╭─────────────────╮                    ╭──────────────╮
       │modal-runtime│──────────────────▶│Task engine│──────────────────▶│Container backend│───────────────────▶│Task container│
       │             │ dispatches tasks  │           │ starts / manages  │                 │ runs user process  │              │
       ╰─────────────╯                   ╰───────────╯                   ╰─────────────────╯                    ╰──────────────╯


       ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
       storage and daemon interfaces
       Engine mounts/snapshots Filesystem + volumes, then Blobnet; runtime to daemon: HTTP/UDS, not worker gRPC.

        ╭───────────╮                            ╭────────────────────╮
        │Task engine│───────────────────────────▶│Filesystem + volumes│────────────────────╮
        │           │    mounts / snapshots      │                    │ image + volume data│
        ╰───────────╯                            ╰────────────────────╯                    │ ╭───────╮
                                                                                           ╰▶│Blobnet│
       ╭─────────────╮   filesystem HTTP over UDS    ╭────────────╮                          │       │
       │modal-runtime│──────────────────────────────▶│modal-daemon│                          ╰───────╯
